{"id":19159,"author":"meezzz","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhen appealing for a temp-ban/ban on the Avicus Network, please include the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username (most recent name if changed)\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003emeezzz\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eBan evasion\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eBecause I was banned in march 2014 and its 1,5 year later.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThere are some things to think about before making an appeal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false?\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eTemp-ban\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false?\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eIt wasn't false\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHave I waited long enough to be un-banned?\u003cb\u003e 1,5 year\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHave I been caught ban evading?\u003cb\u003e Yes\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHave I appealed a ban before?\u003cb\u003e Yes, a few days after i got banned\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhen appealing for a temp-ban/ban on the Avicus Network, please include the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username (most recent name if changed)\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003emeezzz\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eBan evasion\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eBecause I was banned in march 2014 and its 1,5 year later.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThere are some things to think about before making an appeal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false?\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eTemp-ban\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false?\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eI